p['chapters'][3]['items'][3]['title']='Hair, skin, hearing and nerves';p['chapters'][3]['items'][3]['text']='Chemotherapy can cause hair loss. Report new hearing changes, numbness or weakness, and tell the team if these affect balance or daily tasks. Serplulimab can cause immune skin reactions: blistering, peeling or sores around the eyes or mouth need urgent advice.'
