plans[0]['additional_support']=['Use the dedicated carboplatin AUC≥4 high-risk reference (no routine olanzapine): aprepitant125mg Day1 then80mg Days2–3, ondansetron16mg Day1, dexamethasone12mg Day1 then8mg Days2–4; subsequent metoclopramide10mg TDS with duration/suitability prescribed.','Etoposide is given on Days1–3. Reconcile support for each active treatment day and for two days afterwards; a fixed Day1 script alone is not a complete multi-day prescription.','No routine infusion premedication is usually required unless there has been a previous hypersensitivity reaction. Have anaphylaxis facilities available.','If oral etoposide is chosen, confirm capsule strengths, empty-stomach dosing, adherence and handling; no replacement dose after vomiting/missed dose without advice.']
